{#- One document of a case in the reader (slice GG3b; scenario DR), read-only, drawn on the server and complete without a script. The
    title is the one heading of the first level; then, for an email, when it was sent; the file, where there is one (a picture as an
    img, a film as a video with its own controls that loads nothing until it is played, any other file a link, never shown); the
    text with each marked passage a mark element and each line break a br, written on one line so the template adds no space to the
    text; and the marked words as a table with a caption, column headers (th, scope col) and a row header for each span's words (or
    the words that say a span's place is not in the text). Nothing here is a form, a button or a control of the page's own, and
    nothing counts: the page draws what it is given, in the order given. The words are `server/views/documentWords.ts`'s. -#}
{% extends "layout.njk" %}
{% block content %}
{% if view.kind == "document" %}
<h1>{{ view.title }}</h1>
{% if view.sent %}<p>{{ view.sent }}</p>{% endif %}
{% if view.file %}
<h2>{{ words.fileHeading }}</h2>
{% if view.file.kind == "picture" %}<p><img src="{{ view.file.src }}" alt="{{ words.picture }}"></p>
{% elif view.file.kind == "film" %}<p><video src="{{ view.file.src }}" controls preload="none" aria-label="{{ words.film }}"></video></p>
{% else %}<p><a href="{{ view.file.src }}">{{ words.openFile }}</a></p>
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
<h2>{{ words.textHeading }}</h2>
{% if view.truncated %}<p>{{ words.truncated }}</p>{% endif %}
{% if view.someNotPlaced %}<p>{{ words.someNotPlaced }}</p>{% endif %}
{% if view.pieces.length %}
<p id="document-text">{% for piece in view.pieces %}{% if piece.marked %}<mark>{% endif %}{% for line in piece.lines %}{% if not loop.first %}<br>{% endif %}{{ line }}{% endfor %}{% if piece.marked %}</mark>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>
{% else %}
<p id="document-text"></p>
<p>{{ words.noText }}</p>
{% endif %}
<h2>{{ words.marksHeading }}</h2>
{% if view.rows.length %}
<table class="table">
<caption class="caption">{{ words.caption }}</caption>
<thead>
<tr>{% for column in words.columns %}<th scope="col">{{ column }}</th>{% endfor %}</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
{% for row in view.rows %}<tr><th scope="row">{% if row.lines %}{% for line in row.lines %}{% if not loop.first %}<br>{% endif %}{{ line }}{% endfor %}{% else %}{{ words.notInText }}{% endif %}</th><td>{{ row.type }}</td><td>{{ row.how }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}</tbody>
</table>
{% else %}
<p>{{ words.noMarks }}</p>
{% endif %}
<p><a href="{{ view.caseHref }}">{{ words.toCase }}</a></p>
<p><a href="/">{{ words.back }}</a></p>
{% elif view.kind == "ended" %}
<h1>{{ title }}</h1>
<p role="alert">{{ ended }}</p>
<p><a href="/">{{ words.back }}</a></p>
{% else %}
<h1>{{ title }}</h1>
<p role="alert">{{ words.unreadable }}</p>
<p><a href="{{ view.caseHref }}">{{ words.toCase }}</a></p>
<p><a href="/">{{ words.back }}</a></p>
{% endif %}
{% endblock %}
